        <div class="must-know">
          <div class="must-know-header">⚠️ MUST KNOW — Safe Mode Types</div>
          <p>• <strong>Safe Mode</strong> — Minimal drivers, no network</p>
          <p>• <strong>Safe Mode with Networking</strong> — Safe mode + network drivers (for downloading fixes)</p>
          <p>• <strong>Safe Mode with Command Prompt</strong> — No GUI, just command line</p>
          <p>Access via: F8 during boot (older) or Settings → Recovery → Advanced Startup (Windows 10/11)</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Common Windows Problems</h3>
        <table class="data-table">
          <tr><th>Problem</th><th>Solution</th></tr>
          <tr><td>PC won't boot — "Missing OS"</td><td>Check boot order in BIOS, run Startup Repair</td></tr>
          <tr><td>BSOD (Blue Screen)</td><td>Note stop code, check recent drivers, run memory test</td></tr>
