          <p>2. <strong>Quarantine</strong> the infected system (disconnect from network!)</p>
          <p>3. <strong>Disable System Restore</strong> (prevents malware hiding in restore points)</p>
          <p>4. <strong>Remediate</strong> — scan with anti-malware, remove threats</p>
          <p>5. <strong>Schedule scans and run updates</strong></p>
          <p>6. <strong>Enable System Restore</strong> and create a restore point</p>
          <p>7. <strong>Educate the end user</strong></p>
