          <li><strong>Factory reset:</strong> Wipes all data — last resort</li>
          <li><strong>App crashing:</strong> Clear app cache, update app, reinstall</li>
          <li><strong>Battery draining fast:</strong> Check background apps, location services, brightness</li>
